{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34456","headline":"和过张祜处士丹阳故居 · 陆龟蒙","name":"和过张祜处士丹阳故居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"胜华通子共悲辛，荒迳今爲旧宅邻。\n一代交游非不贵，五湖风月合教贫。\n魂应绝地爲才鬼，名与遗编在史臣。\n闻道平生多爱石，至今犹泣洞庭人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34456.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34456","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}